@startuml sntp_exchange
!theme cyborg
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam backgroundColor #0b1018
skinparam defaultFontColor #e6edf7
skinparam ArrowColor #a9b8ca
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
title Generic SNTP exchange: which clock supplies each timestamp (RFC 4330 sec. 4-5, RFC 5905 sec. 8)
participant "Client\n(client clock)" as Client
participant "Server\n(server clock)" as Server
Client -> Server : request; Transmit Timestamp = T1 (client clock)
note over Server : T2 = receive time (server clock)
note over Server : T3 = transmit time (server clock)
Server -> Client : reply: Originate = T1 (copied), Receive = T2, Transmit = T3
note over Client : T4 = destination time (client clock)
note over Client, Server
 Round-trip delay d = (T4 - T1) - (T3 - T2)
 Clock offset t = ((T2 - T1) + (T3 - T4)) / 2
 T1 needs no synchronized client clock (RFC 4330 sec. 5).
 Without authentication the reply is not authenticated (RFC 4330 sec. 11).
end note
@enduml
